<title>USA: Celadon Group Q3 March 31 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Celadon Group Q3 March 31 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		   $0.18 profit	    $0.11</p>
<p> Net profit		   1,359 profit		832</p>
<p> Revs			  47,824		    44,138</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     7,675		     7,884</p>
<p>9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		   $0.46 loss		$0.82</p>
<p> Net profit		   3,530 loss		 6,534</p>
<p> Revs			 140,759		   123,652</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     7,647		     7,922</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The timing of the Easter holiday, which came at the end of March, against April in 1996, and one less workday in 1997, reduced revenues for the third quarter by about $1.2 million, compared with the year-ago quarter.  Assuming a gross margin of of 50 percent on incremental revenues, this equates to approximately $0.05 per share, the company said.</p>
</text>
